# Copy to `.env` and fill in. 
# NOTE: Most configuration (LLM providers, TinyFish, Jina) is now managed in `config.yaml` 
# or via the Web UI Settings panel. Only the following environment variables are read by Onyx:

# ── ScraperAPI (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used by the registry's "scraperapi" fetch provider as a fallback path.
# SCRAPERAPI_KEY=

# ── Telegram Gateway ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Token from @BotFather. Required when config.yaml has `telegram.enabled: true`.
# This env var takes precedence over `telegram.bot_token` in config.yaml.
#TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
